		"description": "<p>At 18th level, you truly become the master of your stronghold. Your stronghold increases to a Grade 6.</p><p>Also at 18th level, you leverage your shield to its maximum effectiveness. If you are hit with a critical hit while wielding a shield, you may turn that hit into a regular hit without sacrificing your shield. You may use this ability a number of times equal to half of your Charisma modifier before your shield breaks and must be repaired.</p>",
